markdown <<MARKDOWN
# Network Components

#### Physical components like routers, switches, and servers work together with both wired and wireless connections to move data across networks.

#### These devices help direct, store, and manage information as it travels from one place to another. By coordinating how data packets are sent and received, network components make it possible for information to be transmitted quickly and reliably across the Internet - locally, nationally, and around the world.

<p align="center">
<img src="https://images.code.org/856b98a1b20b3c544923bc1736b8d759-Screenshot 2025-12-08 at 3.16.15 PM.png" alt="bits can be represented as 1 or 0" width="90%" style="border-radius:10px; border: 5px solid black;">
</p>

